        // So after NETM() and before any burn, totalDistributed = 250000000e18.
        // After burn, totalDistributed = 250000000e18 - burnAmount.
        // After NETM(), totalDistributed remains 250000000e18 - burnAmount.
        // The buggy version does NOT subtract burnAmount from totalDistributed.
        // So the correct final totalDistributed should be 250000000e18 - burnAmount.
